(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Konteyner ve Modüler Kabin Çelik İskeleti: Taban Şasisinden Köşe Dökümüne | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Elektrik odası (e-house), ekipman konteyneri, operatör kabini ve modüler yapıların çelik iskelet imalatında taban şasisi, köşe parçaları, kaldırma noktaları, düzlemsellik, kaynak, korozyon koruması ve taşıma ölçüleri.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Konteyner ve modüler kabin çelik iskeleti","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Modüler Yapılar","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Konteyner ve Modüler Kabin Çelik İskeleti: Taban Şasisinden Köşe Dökümüne","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Konteyner çelik iskeleti","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 dk okuma","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>Elektrik odaları (e-house), ekipman konteynerleri, test kabinleri, operatör kabinleri ve modüler tesis odaları; içine pahalı ekipman yerleştirilen, sonra kamyonla veya gemiyle taşınıp vinçle yerine konan yapılardır. Bu yapıların taşıyıcısı kaynaklı bir çelik iskelettir. İskeletin doğru yapılması, hem içerideki ekipmanın montajını hem de taşıma sırasındaki güvenliği belirler.</p>\n<h2>İskeletin Ana Bölümleri</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Taban şasisi:</strong> Genellikle U veya I profillerden kaynaklı çerçeve; zemin sacı ve ekipman taşıyıcıları bunun üzerine gelir. En çok yük ve en sıkı düzlemsellik beklentisi buradadır.</li>\n<li><strong>Kolonlar ve tavan çerçevesi:</strong> Duvar ve çatı panellerini taşır; kaldırma sırasında burulmayı sınırlar.</li>\n<li><strong>Köşe parçaları:</strong> Standart konteyner boyutlarında ISO köşe dökümleri (corner casting) kullanılır; özel boyutlarda kaynaklı kaldırma ve bağlama noktaları tasarlanır.</li>\n<li><strong>Kablo ve boru geçişleri:</strong> Tabandaki kablo kanalları, çerçevedeki açıklıklar ve takviyeler.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Ölçü ve Düzlemsellik</h2>\n<p>Taban şasisinin düzlemselliği ve köşegen farkı, panel montajı ve kapıların kapanması için önemlidir. Uzun şasilerde kaynak çarpılmasını sınırlamak için simetrik kaynak sırası, ön bombe ve gerektiğinde alevle doğrultma uygulanır (bkz. <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">kaynak distorsiyonu</a> ve <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">alevle doğrultma</a>). Genel toleranslar için ISO 13920 sınıfı çizimde belirtilmelidir (bkz. <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920 tablosu</a>).</p>\n<h2>Kaldırma ve Taşıma</h2>\n<p>Dolu bir modül, iskeletin hiç görmediği yükleri ilk kez vinçle kaldırılırken görür. Kaldırma noktalarının yeri, sapan açıları ve modülün dolu ağırlık merkezi tasarımda dikkate alınmalıdır (bkz. <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">kaldırma kulağı kaynağı</a>). Karayolu taşımasında genişlik ve yükseklik sınırları; deniz taşımasında bağlama noktaları ve standart köşe parçaları belirleyicidir.</p>\n<h2>Korozyon Koruması</h2>\n<p>Modüller çoğunlukla dış ortamda, bazen kıyı veya endüstriyel atmosferde çalışır. Kumlama + çok katlı boya veya sıcak daldırma galvaniz seçimi, korozyon sınıfına göre yapılır (bkz. <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 korozyon sınıfları</a>). Kapalı kutu profillerde iç yüzey koruması ve drenaj delikleri unutulmamalıdır.</p>\n<h2>Tedarikçiye Verilecek Bilgiler</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>İskelet çizimleri ve ekipman yerleşimi (yük noktaları).</li>\n<li>Toplam dolu ağırlık ve ağırlık merkezi.</li>\n<li>Taşıma şekli (karayolu, deniz, ikisi birden).</li>\n<li>Korozyon sınıfı, boya sistemi veya galvaniz.</li>\n<li>Muayene beklentisi: ölçü raporu, VT, kaldırma noktalarında MT/UT.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Modüler kabin ve ekipman konteynerlerinin taban şasisi ve çelik iskeletini çizime göre kaynaklıyor, düzlemsellik ve köşegen ölçülerini raporluyoruz. Kesim, kumlama, boya veya galvanizi iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz; panel ve iç montaj sizin tarafınızda kalıyor. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Çelik konstrüksiyon →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Modüler kabin iskeletinde en kritik bölüm hangisi?</h3><p>Taban şasisi; en çok yükü taşır ve en sıkı düzlemsellik beklentisi oradadır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Standart konteyner köşe parçası kullanmak zorunlu mu?</h3><p>Standart boyut ve deniz taşımasında genellikle evet; özel boyutlarda kaynaklı kaldırma ve bağlama noktaları tasarlanabilir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Uzun şasilerde çarpılma nasıl önlenir?</h3><p>Simetrik kaynak sırası, ön bombe, fikstür ve gerekirse alevle doğrultma ile.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hangi korozyon koruması seçilmeli?</h3><p>Ortamın ISO 12944 korozyon sınıfına göre boya sistemi veya sıcak daldırma galvaniz.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Modüler kabin veya e-house iskeleti mi tedarik ediyorsunuz?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Çizimleri ve taşıma bilgilerini gönderin; kaynaklı iskelet teklifini hazırlayalım.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Jeneratör ve Kompresör Şasisi İmalatı: Tedarikçiye Sorulması Gerekenler","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Çelik Konstrüksiyon İmalat: Tasarımdan Montaja","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korozyon Sınıfları C1–C5 ve CX: Kaynaklı Çelik Parçada Boya Sistemi Seçimi","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Kaynaklı Parça İhracatında Paketleme ve Incoterms: EXW, FCA, DAP ve Hasarsız Teslim"},"en":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Steel Frames for Containers and Modular Cabins: From Base Frame to Corner Castings | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Manufacturing steel frames for e-houses, equipment containers, operator cabins and modular buildings: base frame, corner fittings, lifting points, flatness, welding, corrosion protection and transport dimensions.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Steel frames for containers and modular cabins","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Product Guide · Modular Structures","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Steel Frames for Containers and Modular Cabins: From Base Frame to Corner Castings","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Container steel frames","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min read","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>E-houses, equipment containers, test cabins, operator cabins and modular plant rooms are structures that are fitted with expensive equipment, then moved by truck or ship and craned into place. Their backbone is a welded steel frame. Getting that frame right determines both how easily the equipment is installed and how safely the module travels.</p>\n<h2>Main Parts of the Frame</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Base frame:</strong> usually a welded frame of channels or I-sections; floor plate and equipment supports sit on it. It carries most of the load and has the tightest flatness expectation.</li>\n<li><strong>Columns and roof frame:</strong> carry wall and roof panels and limit twisting during lifting.</li>\n<li><strong>Corner fittings:</strong> standard container sizes use ISO corner castings; special sizes get welded lifting and lashing points.</li>\n<li><strong>Cable and pipe penetrations:</strong> cable trenches in the base, openings and reinforcements in the frame.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Dimensions and Flatness</h2>\n<p>Base frame flatness and diagonal difference matter for panel fitting and for doors that close properly. On long frames, distortion is limited by symmetrical weld sequences, pre-camber and, where needed, flame straightening (see <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">weld distortion</a> and <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">flame straightening</a>). The ISO 13920 class for general tolerances should be on the drawing (see <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920 table</a>).</p>\n<h2>Lifting and Transport</h2>\n<p>A fitted-out module sees loads the frame has never seen when it is first lifted by crane. Lifting point positions, sling angles and the loaded centre of gravity must be considered in design (see <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">lifting lug welding</a>). For road transport, width and height limits govern; for sea transport, lashing points and standard corner fittings do.</p>\n<h2>Corrosion Protection</h2>\n<p>Modules mostly work outdoors, sometimes in coastal or industrial atmospheres. Blasting plus a multi-coat paint system or hot-dip galvanising is chosen by corrosivity category (see <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944 corrosivity categories</a>). Inner surfaces of closed box sections and drain holes must not be forgotten.</p>\n<h2>Information for the Supplier</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Frame drawings and equipment layout (load points).</li>\n<li>Total loaded weight and centre of gravity.</li>\n<li>Mode of transport (road, sea or both).</li>\n<li>Corrosivity category, paint system or galvanising.</li>\n<li>Inspection expectations: dimensional report, VT, MT/UT at lifting points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld base frames and steel skeletons for modular cabins and equipment containers to drawing and report flatness and diagonals. Cutting, blasting, painting or galvanising are coordinated with our partners; panels and interior fit-out stay on your side. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Steel structures →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What is the most critical part of a modular cabin frame?</h3><p>The base frame; it carries most of the load and has the tightest flatness requirement.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Are standard corner castings mandatory?</h3><p>Usually for standard sizes and sea transport; special sizes can have welded lifting and lashing points.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>How is distortion controlled on long frames?</h3><p>With symmetrical weld sequences, pre-camber, fixtures and flame straightening if needed.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which corrosion protection should be chosen?</h3><p>A paint system or hot-dip galvanising matched to the ISO 12944 corrosivity category.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Sourcing modular cabin or e-house frames?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Send drawings and transport details; we will quote the welded frame.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Generator and Compressor Base Frame Fabrication: What to Ask Your Supplier","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Steel Structure Manufacturing: From Design to Erection","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Corrosivity Categories C1–C5 and CX: Choosing a Coating System for Welded Steel","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Packing and Incoterms for Exported Welded Parts: EXW, FCA, DAP and Damage-Free Delivery"},"de":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Stahlrahmen für Container und Modulkabinen: vom Grundrahmen bis zum Eckbeschlag | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Fertigung von Stahlrahmen für E-Houses, Gerätecontainer, Bedienkabinen und Modulbauten: Grundrahmen, Eckbeschläge, Anschlagpunkte, Ebenheit, Schweißen, Korrosionsschutz und Transportmaße.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Stahlrahmen für Container und Modulkabinen","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Modulbau","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Stahlrahmen für Container und Modulkabinen: vom Grundrahmen bis zum Eckbeschlag","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Container-Stahlrahmen","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>E-Houses, Gerätecontainer, Prüfkabinen, Bedienkabinen und modulare Anlagenräume werden mit teurer Technik bestückt, dann per Lkw oder Schiff transportiert und per Kran abgesetzt. Ihr Rückgrat ist ein geschweißter Stahlrahmen. Ein sauber gefertigter Rahmen entscheidet über die Montage der Technik und die Sicherheit beim Transport.</p>\n<h2>Hauptbestandteile des Rahmens</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grundrahmen:</strong> meist ein geschweißter Rahmen aus U- oder I-Profilen; Bodenblech und Geräteauflagen sitzen darauf. Hier liegen die größten Lasten und die engste Ebenheitserwartung.</li>\n<li><strong>Stützen und Dachrahmen:</strong> tragen Wand- und Dachpaneele und begrenzen die Verwindung beim Heben.</li>\n<li><strong>Eckbeschläge:</strong> Bei Standardcontainermaßen ISO-Eckbeschläge (Corner Castings); bei Sondermaßen geschweißte Anschlag- und Zurrpunkte.</li>\n<li><strong>Kabel- und Rohrdurchführungen:</strong> Kabelkanäle im Boden, Öffnungen und Verstärkungen im Rahmen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Maße und Ebenheit</h2>\n<p>Ebenheit und Diagonalendifferenz des Grundrahmens sind für die Paneelmontage und schließende Türen wichtig. Bei langen Rahmen begrenzen symmetrische Schweißfolge, Vorüberhöhung und bei Bedarf Flammrichten den Verzug (siehe <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">Schweißverzug</a> und <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">Flammrichten</a>). Die ISO-13920-Klasse für Allgemeintoleranzen gehört auf die Zeichnung (siehe <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO-13920-Tabelle</a>).</p>\n<h2>Heben und Transport</h2>\n<p>Ein ausgebautes Modul erfährt beim ersten Kranhub Lasten, die der Rahmen nie zuvor gesehen hat. Lage der Anschlagpunkte, Seilwinkel und der Schwerpunkt im beladenen Zustand gehören in die Konstruktion (siehe <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">Anschlagösen anschweißen</a>). Beim Straßentransport bestimmen Breiten- und Höhengrenzen, beim Seetransport Zurrpunkte und Standard-Eckbeschläge.</p>\n<h2>Korrosionsschutz</h2>\n<p>Module stehen meist im Freien, teils in Küsten- oder Industrieatmosphäre. Strahlen plus Mehrschichtbeschichtung oder Feuerverzinkung werden nach Korrosivitätskategorie gewählt (siehe <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO-12944-Kategorien</a>). Innenflächen geschlossener Hohlprofile und Entwässerungsbohrungen nicht vergessen.</p>\n<h2>Angaben für den Lieferanten</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rahmenzeichnungen und Gerätelayout (Lastpunkte).</li>\n<li>Gesamtgewicht beladen und Schwerpunkt.</li>\n<li>Transportart (Straße, See oder beides).</li>\n<li>Korrosivitätskategorie, Beschichtungssystem oder Verzinkung.</li>\n<li>Prüferwartung: Maßbericht, VT, MT/UT an Anschlagpunkten.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Grundrahmen und Stahlgerüste für Modulkabinen und Gerätecontainer nach Zeichnung und dokumentieren Ebenheit und Diagonalen. Zuschnitt, Strahlen, Lackieren oder Verzinken koordinieren wir mit Partnern; Paneele und Innenausbau bleiben bei Ihnen. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stahlbau →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welcher Teil des Modulrahmens ist am kritischsten?</h3><p>Der Grundrahmen; er trägt die meisten Lasten und hat die engste Ebenheitsanforderung.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Sind Standard-Eckbeschläge Pflicht?</h3><p>Bei Standardmaßen und Seetransport meist ja; Sondermaße können geschweißte Anschlag- und Zurrpunkte erhalten.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wie wird Verzug bei langen Rahmen begrenzt?</h3><p>Durch symmetrische Schweißfolge, Vorüberhöhung, Vorrichtungen und ggf. Flammrichten.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welcher Korrosionsschutz?</h3><p>Beschichtung oder Feuerverzinkung passend zur ISO-12944-Korrosivitätskategorie.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Rahmen für Modulkabinen oder E-Houses gesucht?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Senden Sie Zeichnungen und Transportdaten; wir bieten den geschweißten Rahmen an.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Grundrahmen für Generatoren und Kompressoren: Was man den Lieferanten fragen sollte","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stahlkonstruktion: Von der Konstruktion zur Montage","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 Korrosivitätskategorien C1–C5 und CX: Beschichtungssystem für geschweißte Stahlteile","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Verpackung und Incoterms beim Export von Schweißteilen: EXW, FCA, DAP und schadensfreie Lieferung"},"es":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Estructuras de acero para contenedores y cabinas modulares: de la base a las esquineras | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Fabricación de estructuras de acero para e-houses, contenedores de equipos, cabinas de operador y edificios modulares: bastidor base, esquineras, puntos de izado, planitud, soldadura, protección anticorrosiva y medidas de transporte.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Estructuras de acero para contenedores modulares","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Guía de producto · Construcción modular","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Estructuras de acero para contenedores y cabinas modulares: de la base a las esquineras","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Estructuras de contenedores","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min de lectura","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>Las salas eléctricas (e-house), contenedores de equipos, cabinas de ensayo, cabinas de operador y salas modulares se equipan con material caro, se transportan por carretera o mar y se colocan con grúa. Su esqueleto es una estructura de acero soldada. Hacerla bien determina tanto el montaje del equipo como la seguridad durante el transporte.</p>\n<h2>Partes principales</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bastidor base:</strong> normalmente un marco soldado de perfiles U o I; sobre él van chapa de suelo y soportes de equipos. Concentra la mayor carga y la exigencia de planitud más estricta.</li>\n<li><strong>Pilares y marco de techo:</strong> soportan paneles de pared y cubierta y limitan la torsión al izar.</li>\n<li><strong>Esquineras:</strong> en medidas estándar se usan esquineras ISO (corner castings); en medidas especiales se diseñan puntos soldados de izado y trincaje.</li>\n<li><strong>Pasos de cables y tuberías:</strong> canales en el suelo, aberturas y refuerzos en el marco.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Medidas y planitud</h2>\n<p>La planitud y la diferencia de diagonales del bastidor base importan para montar paneles y para que las puertas cierren. En bastidores largos la distorsión se limita con secuencia simétrica, contraflecha y, si hace falta, enderezado a la llama (ver <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">distorsión de soldadura</a> y <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">enderezado a la llama</a>). La clase ISO 13920 de tolerancias generales debe figurar en el plano (ver <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">tabla ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Izado y transporte</h2>\n<p>Un módulo equipado soporta en el primer izado cargas que la estructura nunca ha visto. La posición de los puntos de izado, los ángulos de eslinga y el centro de gravedad cargado deben considerarse en el diseño (ver <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">soldadura de orejetas</a>). En carretera mandan los límites de ancho y alto; en transporte marítimo, los puntos de trincaje y las esquineras estándar.</p>\n<h2>Protección anticorrosiva</h2>\n<p>Los módulos suelen trabajar al exterior, a veces en ambiente costero o industrial. Granallado más pintura multicapa o galvanizado en caliente se eligen según la categoría de corrosividad (ver <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">categorías ISO 12944</a>). No olvidar el interior de perfiles cerrados ni los agujeros de drenaje.</p>\n<h2>Información para el proveedor</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Planos de estructura y disposición de equipos (puntos de carga).</li>\n<li>Peso total cargado y centro de gravedad.</li>\n<li>Modo de transporte (carretera, mar o ambos).</li>\n<li>Categoría de corrosividad, sistema de pintura o galvanizado.</li>\n<li>Inspección esperada: informe dimensional, VT, MT/UT en puntos de izado.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos bastidores base y estructuras de cabinas modulares y contenedores según plano e informamos planitud y diagonales. Corte, granallado, pintura o galvanizado se coordinan con socios; paneles y montaje interior quedan de su lado. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Estructuras metálicas →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cuál es la parte más crítica?</h3><p>El bastidor base; soporta la mayor carga y tiene la exigencia de planitud más estricta.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Son obligatorias las esquineras estándar?</h3><p>Normalmente en medidas estándar y transporte marítimo; en medidas especiales pueden usarse puntos soldados.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cómo se controla la distorsión?</h3><p>Con secuencia simétrica, contraflecha, utillajes y enderezado a la llama si es necesario.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué protección anticorrosiva elegir?</h3><p>Pintura o galvanizado en caliente según la categoría ISO 12944.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"¿Compra estructuras para cabinas modulares o e-houses?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Envíe planos y datos de transporte; ofertaremos la estructura soldada.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Bastidores para grupos electrógenos y compresores: qué preguntar al proveedor","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabricación de Estructuras Metálicas: del Diseño al Montaje","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorías de corrosividad C1–C5 y CX: elegir el sistema de pintura para acero soldado","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Embalaje e Incoterms para exportar piezas soldadas: EXW, FCA, DAP y entrega sin daños"},"fr":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Ossatures acier pour conteneurs et cabines modulaires : du châssis de base aux pièces de coin | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Fabrication d'ossatures acier pour e-houses, conteneurs d'équipements, cabines opérateur et bâtiments modulaires : châssis de base, pièces de coin, points de levage, planéité, soudage, protection anticorrosion et gabarits de transport.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Ossatures acier pour conteneurs modulaires","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Guide produit · Construction modulaire","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Ossatures acier pour conteneurs et cabines modulaires : du châssis de base aux pièces de coin","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Ossatures de conteneurs","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min de lecture","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>Les locaux électriques (e-house), conteneurs d'équipements, cabines d'essai, cabines opérateur et salles modulaires sont équipés de matériel coûteux, transportés par route ou par mer, puis posés à la grue. Leur ossature est une structure acier soudée. Bien la réaliser conditionne le montage des équipements comme la sécurité du transport.</p>\n<h2>Parties principales</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Châssis de base :</strong> en général un cadre soudé en profilés U ou I portant tôle de plancher et supports d'équipements. Il porte l'essentiel des charges et a l'exigence de planéité la plus serrée.</li>\n<li><strong>Poteaux et cadre de toit :</strong> portent panneaux de paroi et de toiture et limitent la torsion au levage.</li>\n<li><strong>Pièces de coin :</strong> pour les dimensions standard, pièces de coin ISO (corner castings) ; pour les dimensions spéciales, points de levage et d'arrimage soudés.</li>\n<li><strong>Passages de câbles et tuyauteries :</strong> caniveaux dans le plancher, ouvertures et renforts dans le cadre.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Cotes et planéité</h2>\n<p>Planéité et écart de diagonales du châssis de base comptent pour la pose des panneaux et la fermeture des portes. Sur les châssis longs, la déformation est limitée par une séquence symétrique, une contre-flèche et si besoin un dressage à la flamme (voir <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">déformation de soudage</a> et <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">dressage à la flamme</a>). La classe ISO 13920 des tolérances générales doit figurer au plan (voir <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">tableau ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Levage et transport</h2>\n<p>Un module équipé subit au premier levage des efforts que l'ossature n'a jamais connus. Position des points de levage, angles d'élingue et centre de gravité en charge doivent être pris en compte à la conception (voir <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">soudage des oreilles de levage</a>). Par route, les limites de largeur et de hauteur s'imposent ; par mer, les points d'arrimage et pièces de coin standard.</p>\n<h2>Protection anticorrosion</h2>\n<p>Les modules travaillent souvent en extérieur, parfois en atmosphère marine ou industrielle. Grenaillage plus système de peinture multicouche ou galvanisation à chaud se choisissent selon la catégorie de corrosivité (voir <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">catégories ISO 12944</a>). Ne pas oublier l'intérieur des profils creux ni les trous de drainage.</p>\n<h2>Informations pour le fournisseur</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Plans d'ossature et implantation des équipements (points de charge).</li>\n<li>Poids total en charge et centre de gravité.</li>\n<li>Mode de transport (route, mer ou les deux).</li>\n<li>Catégorie de corrosivité, système de peinture ou galvanisation.</li>\n<li>Contrôles attendus : rapport dimensionnel, VT, MT/UT aux points de levage.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons châssis de base et ossatures de cabines modulaires et conteneurs selon plan, et consignons planéité et diagonales. Découpe, grenaillage, peinture ou galvanisation sont coordonnés avec nos partenaires ; panneaux et aménagement intérieur restent chez vous. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Charpente métallique →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle est la partie la plus critique ?</h3><p>Le châssis de base ; il porte l'essentiel des charges et a l'exigence de planéité la plus stricte.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Les pièces de coin standard sont-elles obligatoires ?</h3><p>En général pour les dimensions standard et le transport maritime ; les dimensions spéciales peuvent avoir des points soudés.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Comment limiter la déformation ?</h3><p>Séquence symétrique, contre-flèche, gabarits et dressage à la flamme si nécessaire.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle protection choisir ?</h3><p>Peinture ou galvanisation à chaud selon la catégorie ISO 12944.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Vous achetez des ossatures de cabines ou d'e-houses ?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Envoyez plans et données de transport ; nous chiffrerons l'ossature soudée.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Châssis de groupes électrogènes et compresseurs : les questions à poser au fournisseur","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabrication de Charpentes Métalliques : du Calcul au Montage","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 catégories de corrosivité C1–C5 et CX : choisir le système de peinture pour l’acier soudé","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Emballage et Incoterms pour l’export de pièces soudées : EXW, FCA, DAP et livraison sans dommage"},"it":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Telai in acciaio per container e cabine modulari: dal telaio di base ai blocchi d'angolo | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Produzione di telai in acciaio per e-house, container per apparecchiature, cabine operatore ed edifici modulari: telaio di base, blocchi d'angolo, punti di sollevamento, planarità, saldatura, protezione anticorrosiva e sagome di trasporto.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Telai in acciaio per container modulari","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Guida prodotto · Strutture modulari","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Telai in acciaio per container e cabine modulari: dal telaio di base ai blocchi d'angolo","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Telai per container","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min di lettura","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>Cabine elettriche (e-house), container per apparecchiature, cabine di prova, cabine operatore e locali modulari vengono allestiti con apparecchiature costose, trasportati su strada o via mare e posati con la gru. La loro ossatura è un telaio in acciaio saldato. Realizzarlo bene decide sia il montaggio delle apparecchiature sia la sicurezza nel trasporto.</p>\n<h2>Parti principali</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Telaio di base:</strong> di solito un telaio saldato in profili U o I su cui poggiano lamiera di pavimento e supporti. Porta il carico maggiore e ha la richiesta di planarità più stretta.</li>\n<li><strong>Montanti e telaio di copertura:</strong> sostengono pannelli di parete e tetto e limitano la torsione in sollevamento.</li>\n<li><strong>Blocchi d'angolo:</strong> per misure standard si usano corner casting ISO; per misure speciali si progettano punti saldati di sollevamento e rizzaggio.</li>\n<li><strong>Passaggi cavi e tubi:</strong> canalette nel pavimento, aperture e rinforzi nel telaio.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Misure e planarità</h2>\n<p>Planarità e differenza delle diagonali del telaio di base contano per il montaggio dei pannelli e per la chiusura delle porte. Sui telai lunghi la distorsione si limita con sequenze simmetriche, controfreccia e, se serve, raddrizzatura a fiamma (vedi <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">distorsione da saldatura</a> e <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">raddrizzatura a fiamma</a>). La classe ISO 13920 delle tolleranze generali va indicata a disegno (vedi <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">tabella ISO 13920</a>).</p>\n<h2>Sollevamento e trasporto</h2>\n<p>Un modulo allestito subisce al primo sollevamento carichi che il telaio non ha mai visto. Posizione dei punti di sollevamento, angoli delle brache e baricentro a pieno carico vanno considerati in progetto (vedi <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">saldatura dei golfari</a>). Su strada contano i limiti di larghezza e altezza; via mare i punti di rizzaggio e i blocchi d'angolo standard.</p>\n<h2>Protezione anticorrosiva</h2>\n<p>I moduli lavorano per lo più all'aperto, a volte in atmosfera marina o industriale. Sabbiatura più ciclo di verniciatura multistrato o zincatura a caldo si scelgono in base alla categoria di corrosività (vedi <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">categorie ISO 12944</a>). Non dimenticare l'interno dei profili chiusi e i fori di drenaggio.</p>\n<h2>Informazioni per il fornitore</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Disegni del telaio e layout delle apparecchiature (punti di carico).</li>\n<li>Peso totale a pieno carico e baricentro.</li>\n<li>Modalità di trasporto (strada, mare o entrambi).</li>\n<li>Categoria di corrosività, ciclo di verniciatura o zincatura.</li>\n<li>Controlli attesi: rapporto dimensionale, VT, MT/UT nei punti di sollevamento.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo telai di base e ossature di cabine modulari e container a disegno e registriamo planarità e diagonali. Taglio, sabbiatura, verniciatura o zincatura sono coordinati con i partner; pannelli e allestimento interno restano a voi. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Carpenteria metallica →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Qual è la parte più critica?</h3><p>Il telaio di base; porta il carico maggiore e ha la richiesta di planarità più stretta.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>I blocchi d'angolo standard sono obbligatori?</h3><p>Di solito per misure standard e trasporto marittimo; le misure speciali possono avere punti saldati.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Come si limita la distorsione?</h3><p>Con sequenze simmetriche, controfreccia, maschere e raddrizzatura a fiamma se necessario.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale protezione scegliere?</h3><p>Verniciatura o zincatura a caldo secondo la categoria ISO 12944.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Acquistate telai per cabine modulari o e-house?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Inviate disegni e dati di trasporto; quoteremo il telaio saldato.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Basamenti per gruppi elettrogeni e compressori: cosa chiedere al fornitore","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Carpenteria metallica: dalla progettazione al montaggio","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 categorie di corrosività C1–C5 e CX: scegliere il ciclo di verniciatura per l’acciaio saldato","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Imballaggio e Incoterms per l’export di pezzi saldati: EXW, FCA, DAP e consegna senza danni"},"nl":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Stalen frames voor containers en modulaire cabines: van grondframe tot hoekstukken | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Productie van stalen frames voor e-houses, apparatuurcontainers, bedieningscabines en modulaire gebouwen: grondframe, hoekstukken, hijspunten, vlakheid, lassen, corrosiebescherming en transportmaten.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Stalen frames voor modulaire containers","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Productgids · Modulaire bouw","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Stalen frames voor containers en modulaire cabines: van grondframe tot hoekstukken","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Containerframes","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min lezen","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>E-houses, apparatuurcontainers, testcabines, bedieningscabines en modulaire installatieruimtes worden met dure apparatuur ingericht, over weg of zee vervoerd en met een kraan geplaatst. Hun ruggengraat is een gelast stalen frame. Een goed gemaakt frame bepaalt zowel de montage van de apparatuur als de veiligheid tijdens transport.</p>\n<h2>Hoofdonderdelen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grondframe:</strong> meestal een gelast frame van U- of I-profielen waarop vloerplaat en apparatuursteunen komen. Hier zitten de grootste lasten en de strengste vlakheidseis.</li>\n<li><strong>Kolommen en dakframe:</strong> dragen wand- en dakpanelen en beperken torsie tijdens het hijsen.</li>\n<li><strong>Hoekstukken:</strong> bij standaardmaten ISO-hoekstukken (corner castings); bij speciale maten gelaste hijs- en sjorpunten.</li>\n<li><strong>Kabel- en leidingdoorvoeren:</strong> kabelgoten in de vloer, openingen en versterkingen in het frame.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Maten en vlakheid</h2>\n<p>Vlakheid en diagonaalverschil van het grondframe zijn belangrijk voor panelmontage en goed sluitende deuren. Bij lange frames beperken een symmetrische lasvolgorde, voorzeeg en zo nodig vlamrichten de vervorming (zie <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">lasvervorming</a> en <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">vlamrichten</a>). De ISO 13920-klasse voor algemene toleranties hoort op tekening (zie <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920-tabel</a>).</p>\n<h2>Hijsen en transport</h2>\n<p>Een ingerichte module krijgt bij de eerste kraanhijs lasten te verwerken die het frame nooit eerder zag. Positie van hijspunten, stophoeken en het zwaartepunt in beladen toestand horen in het ontwerp (zie <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">hijsogen lassen</a>). Over de weg bepalen breedte- en hoogtegrenzen; over zee sjorpunten en standaard hoekstukken.</p>\n<h2>Corrosiebescherming</h2>\n<p>Modules staan meestal buiten, soms in kust- of industriële atmosfeer. Stralen plus een meerlagig verfsysteem of thermisch verzinken worden gekozen op corrosiviteitscategorie (zie <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944-categorieën</a>). Vergeet de binnenkant van gesloten kokerprofielen en drainagegaten niet.</p>\n<h2>Informatie voor de leverancier</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Frametekeningen en apparatuurindeling (lastpunten).</li>\n<li>Totaalgewicht beladen en zwaartepunt.</li>\n<li>Transportwijze (weg, zee of beide).</li>\n<li>Corrosiviteitscategorie, verfsysteem of verzinken.</li>\n<li>Inspectieverwachting: maatrapport, VT, MT/UT bij hijspunten.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen grondframes en stalen skeletten voor modulaire cabines en apparatuurcontainers volgens tekening en rapporteren vlakheid en diagonalen. Snijden, stralen, lakken of verzinken coördineren we met partners; panelen en binneninrichting blijven bij u. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Staalconstructies →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wat is het meest kritische deel?</h3><p>Het grondframe; het draagt de meeste last en heeft de strengste vlakheidseis.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Zijn standaard hoekstukken verplicht?</h3><p>Meestal bij standaardmaten en zeetransport; speciale maten kunnen gelaste punten krijgen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hoe beperk je vervorming?</h3><p>Met symmetrische lasvolgorde, voorzeeg, mallen en zo nodig vlamrichten.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke corrosiebescherming?</h3><p>Verfsysteem of thermisch verzinken passend bij de ISO 12944-categorie.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Frames voor modulaire cabines of e-houses nodig?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Stuur tekeningen en transportgegevens; we offreren het gelaste frame.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Onderstellen voor aggregaten en compressoren: wat vraag je de leverancier?","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Staalbouw: van ontwerp tot montage","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 corrosiviteitscategorieën C1–C5 en CX: coatingsysteem kiezen voor gelast staal","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Verpakking en Incoterms bij export van lasdelen: EXW, FCA, DAP en schadevrije levering"},"no":{"blog_p83_cabinframe_title":"Stålrammer for containere og modulære kabiner: fra bunnramme til hjørnebeslag | ArmaWeld","blog_p83_cabinframe_meta_desc":"Produksjon av stålrammer for e-house, utstyrscontainere, førerkabiner og modulbygg: bunnramme, hjørnebeslag, løftepunkter, planhet, sveising, korrosjonsbeskyttelse og transportmål.","blog_p83_cabinframe_og_title":"Stålrammer for modulære containere","blog_p83_cabinframe_tag":"Produktguide · Modulbygg","blog_p83_cabinframe_h1":"Stålrammer for containere og modulære kabiner: fra bunnramme til hjørnebeslag","blog_p83_cabinframe_breadcrumb3":"Containerrammer","blog_p83_cabinframe_read":"7 min lesing","blog_p83_cabinframe_body":"<p>E-house, utstyrscontainere, testkabiner, førerkabiner og modulære anleggsrom utstyres med kostbart utstyr, fraktes på vei eller sjø og settes på plass med kran. Ryggraden er en sveiset stålramme. En riktig utført ramme avgjør både montasjen av utstyret og sikkerheten under transport.</p>\n<h2>Hoveddeler</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bunnramme:</strong> vanligvis en sveiset ramme av U- eller I-profiler med gulvplate og utstyrsopplegg. Her er de største lastene og strengeste planhetskravene.</li>\n<li><strong>Søyler og takramme:</strong> bærer vegg- og takpaneler og begrenser vridning under løft.</li>\n<li><strong>Hjørnebeslag:</strong> ved standardmål ISO-hjørnebeslag (corner castings); ved spesialmål sveisede løfte- og surringspunkter.</li>\n<li><strong>Kabel- og rørgjennomføringer:</strong> kabelkanaler i gulvet, åpninger og forsterkninger i rammen.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Mål og planhet</h2>\n<p>Planhet og diagonalavvik i bunnrammen er viktig for panelmontasje og dører som lukker. På lange rammer begrenses deformasjon med symmetrisk sveiserekkefølge, forhåndsoppbøyning og ved behov flammeretting (se <a href=\"kaynak-distorsiyonu.html\">sveisedeformasjon</a> og <a href=\"alevle-dogrultma-kaynak-carpilmasi.html\">flammeretting</a>). ISO 13920-klassen for generelle toleranser skal stå på tegningen (se <a href=\"iso-13920-kaynakli-imalat-tolerans-tablosu.html\">ISO 13920-tabell</a>).</p>\n<h2>Løft og transport</h2>\n<p>En utrustet modul utsettes ved første kranløft for laster rammen aldri har sett. Plassering av løftepunkter, stroppevinkler og tyngdepunkt i lastet tilstand må med i konstruksjonen (se <a href=\"kaldirma-kulagi-lifting-lug-kaynagi.html\">sveising av løfteører</a>). På vei styrer bredde- og høydegrenser; til sjøs surringspunkter og standard hjørnebeslag.</p>\n<h2>Korrosjonsbeskyttelse</h2>\n<p>Moduler står oftest ute, noen ganger i kyst- eller industriatmosfære. Blåsing pluss flerlags malingssystem eller varmforsinking velges etter korrosivitetskategori (se <a href=\"iso-12944-korozyon-siniflari-c1-c5-cx.html\">ISO 12944-kategorier</a>). Glem ikke innsiden av lukkede hulprofiler og dreneringshull.</p>\n<h2>Opplysninger til leverandøren</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rammetegninger og utstyrsplassering (lastpunkter).</li>\n<li>Total lastet vekt og tyngdepunkt.</li>\n<li>Transportmåte (vei, sjø eller begge).</li>\n<li>Korrosivitetskategori, malingssystem eller forsinking.</li>\n<li>Kontrollforventning: målrapport, VT, MT/UT ved løftepunkter.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser bunnrammer og stålskjeletter for modulære kabiner og utstyrscontainere etter tegning og rapporterer planhet og diagonaler. Kutting, blåsing, maling eller forsinking koordineres med partnere; paneler og innredning blir hos dere. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stålkonstruksjoner →</a></p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hva er den mest kritiske delen?</h3><p>Bunnrammen; den bærer mest last og har strengeste planhetskrav.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Er standard hjørnebeslag påkrevd?</h3><p>Som regel ved standardmål og sjøtransport; spesialmål kan få sveisede punkter.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvordan begrenses deformasjon?</h3><p>Med symmetrisk sveiserekkefølge, forhåndsoppbøyning, fikstur og ev. flammeretting.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken korrosjonsbeskyttelse?</h3><p>Maling eller varmforsinking tilpasset ISO 12944-kategorien.</p></div>","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_h3":"Trenger du rammer til modulære kabiner eller e-house?","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_p":"Send tegninger og transportdata; vi gir tilbud på den sveiste rammen.","blog_p83_cabinframe_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_p78_genset_h1":"Grunnrammer for aggregater og kompressorer: hva du bør spørre leverandøren","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stålkonstruksjonsproduksjon: Fra design til montasje","blog_p22_iso12944_h1":"ISO 12944 korrosivitetskategorier C1–C5 og CX: velge malingssystem for sveiset stål","blog_p40_packing_h1":"Pakking og Incoterms ved eksport av sveisede deler: EXW, FCA, DAP og skadefri levering"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
